\begin_inset Formula 
\[
x^{*}\equiv\begin{cases}
\bar{x} & \mbox{if}\ \bar{x}\succ x_{n+1}\\
x_{n+1} & \mbox{if}\ x_{n+1}\succsim\bar{x}
\end{cases}
\]

\end_inset

Thus, 
\begin_inset Formula $\exists\ x^{*}\in X,\forall\ x\in X:x^{*}\succsim x$
\end_inset

.
